Third-party material

Software dependencies are listed in Cargo.lock. DWG files are read and written by DraftCraft's own
code (crates/dwg, crates/io), from the Open Design Alliance's public DWG specification and our own
tests.


DraftCraft's icons, drafting font, hatch patterns and linetypes are drawn or defined in code.
The UI also bundles the egui font inputs described below. The per-file list is in ATTRIBUTION.md.
Builds made with the optional craft-fonts input (CRAFT_FONTS_DIR) embed the fonts listed in its
ATTRIBUTION.md, each under the SIL Open Font License 1.1.

